# Compiled / native / decompiled binaries — NEVER commit (vendor IP risk)
*.so
*.dex
*.aar
*.class
*.smali

# Captures / private data — NEVER commit raw logs or DB (may contain personal data)
btsnoop*
*.btsnoop
bugreport*
*.ab
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
phone_db/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
*.swp
.vscode/

# Agent scratch. `.claude/worktrees/` holds full checkouts of this repo —
# hundreds of MB of working trees and build output that must never be staged.
# It was untracked but NOT ignored, which is one `git add -A` away from a mess;
# the same gap that let `raw/` sit outside this file for weeks (see CLAUDE.md).
.claude/
